  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "燦光寮山"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>作者：藍春瑞</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">海拔738公尺ê燦光寮山（tshàn-kong-liâu-suann），有一等ê三角點kap衛星控制點，tī貢寮（槓仔寮，Khōng-á-liâu）、瑞芳kap雙溪交界ê所在，是基隆火山群上kuân ê山，四箍liàn-tńg khah低ê山崙、溪崁，íng過tsiâu是挖金仔ê礦區，ē號做「燦光」tsit兩字ê緣故，正正是tuì tsia來--ê。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Beh去燦光寮山，ài tuì 102號縣道倒uat草山公路行--入-去，規tsuā ê石頭仔路無kài好行，大體仔半點鐘到山跤，有tsiânn明ê指示牌leh報路，免驚ē gông山--去。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">起崎ê路喙一直到崙頂，ba̍t-ba̍t是ê菅芒，旺kah kiōng-beh kā路淹--去，比菅芒khah頂層--ê，有真濟開白花ê油茶仔、結子tsiânn古錐ê黃楊插tī內底；pōng著khah無塗肉ê石縫，iáu有野生ê滿山紅kap mooh tī岩壁、開花tsiânn細蕊ê唐杜鵑，倚tī三角點邊--a，mā有古早冰河期留--落-來ê森氏杜鵑、鐘萼木kap雲葉樹，lóng是suí-tang-tang koh tsiânn罕見ê植物tsiah是寶。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">徛踮山頭tuì東爿看--去，鼻頭、蠓仔坑、福隆kap上遠ê三貂角lóng看現現；se̍h來南勢，牡丹坑車頭、雙溪ê密婆山拄好倚tī跤邊；西向kap五分仔山、羌仔寮山sio連，降落來山跤ê基隆河bē輸一尾大蛇，kā猴硐仔（Kâu-tōng-á）、瑞芳纏--著；上鬧熱--ê是北向ê海跤，liòng起liòng落ê海湧親像規陣白馬仔leh走sio-jiok，kā無耳茶古山、基隆山、南仔吝山（Lâm-á-bīn-suann）圍ân-ân，hōo bih tī內底ê九份仔、金瓜石kap水湳洞（Tsuí-lâm-tōng）無暝無日leh滾絞bē煞；是講，我khah ài燦光寮山ê古意、恬靜，伊lóng照寒熱、節氣leh搬徙光景，hōo人ē按算，koh m̄ bat tîng-tânn--過。</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">（Tsit篇文章bat刊tī教育部電子報，漢羅用字有調整，原文網址：<a href=\"https://reurl.cc/WXxnk7\" target=\"_blank\">https://reurl.cc/WXxnk7</a>）</span></div><p><br /></p><div><br /></div><div><br /></div><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div><span><b style=\"font-family: inherit;\">#</b><span><b>阿瑞--ā話仙</b><b style=\"font-family: inherit;\">&nbsp;專欄，本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap臺灣閩南語羅馬字拼音方案。</b></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><b>台文通訊BONG報332期，2021年11月出刊。</b></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><b><br /></b></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjL-PGrs9HC3qCU9np6Tnmbxu5jSddtKy3R5u6fPyEqew8Sin7AaHQs9pPLdYYtQ2hKoSJ2lM8KZEfuNPe3253vl5s-6R6LPe0s5Tk6MMBkahx6y37abp7ZGBqvTvRBx3EPp5y4lFacJ0apN_8gebbVv1WCSRnuxBgs_B2QCTTymKQuXZGNLRbW98hnXg=s1424\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjL-PGrs9HC3qCU9np6Tnmbxu5jSddtKy3R5u6fPyEqew8Sin7AaHQs9pPLdYYtQ2hKoSJ2lM8KZEfuNPe3253vl5s-6R6LPe0s5Tk6MMBkahx6y37abp7ZGBqvTvRBx3EPp5y4lFacJ0apN_8gebbVv1WCSRnuxBgs_B2QCTTymKQuXZGNLRbW98hnXg=w450-h640\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhR3wpOYpxNNeoMlYma6rCrVEcll79l8ef0dibjqDIosQsenL_KgAZ8P1T7BIDA8--vsZywJaQgdtNablAexgm0h95oYkhqHIqJ8P36xVquXGOAZwqCp1ZBBp3-wrGNgNyuMPYP88y3enTroHUs03v_rJfRPRr2TWuR05B8Zmoka3cNnfTc6E1i59uhvw=s3036\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhR3wpOYpxNNeoMlYma6rCrVEcll79l8ef0dibjqDIosQsenL_KgAZ8P1T7BIDA8--vsZywJaQgdtNablAexgm0h95oYkhqHIqJ8P36xVquXGOAZwqCp1ZBBp3-wrGNgNyuMPYP88y3enTroHUs03v_rJfRPRr2TWuR05B8Zmoka3cNnfTc6E1i59uhvw=w454-h640\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /></span></div><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><div align=\"center\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會　</span></span></h3><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: large; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\">（捐款可抵稅，匯款後請通知02-23112199）</span></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><div style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"color: #38761d;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>線上捐款(定期定額) </span><a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk\" target=\"_blank\">https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk</a></div></span><span style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>線上捐款(單筆) </span><a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk\" target=\"_blank\">https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk</a></div></span></span></span><span style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: justify;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">郵政劃撥：19021486</div><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\">電匯：123-20-050514-2</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">華南銀行士林分行活儲</div></span><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</div></span></span></h3><div style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #050505; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></span></div><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: left;\"></span></div><div style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: 15px;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"></div><div style=\"text-align: start;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #999999;\">李江却台語文教基金會需要你ê定期捐款，逐個月捐助NT$200以上，lán做伙來推動復振台灣語文ê事工，歡迎利用劃撥、電匯、信用卡、郵局『存簿儲金自動轉帳』扣款iah是線頂捐款、現金贊助。</span><br /><span style=\"color: #999999;\"><br /></span></span></div></div><div style=\"text-align: start;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: medium;\"></span></div></div><div style=\"text-align: start;\"><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #999999;\">◎逐個月贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$200（iah是逐冬NT$2,400）以上，</span><span style=\"color: #999999;\">做伙支持基金會事工kap雜誌編印發行費用。歡迎利用郵局劃撥、信用卡（寫捐款單）、線頂捐款、現金贊助、銀行/ATM轉帳（轉帳了後請通知）、支票、郵局戶頭自動轉帳扣繳（寫授權書），捐款收據ē-tàng做『列舉扣除額』抵稅ê用途。</span></span></div></div></div></div><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"></span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div></div></div>"
  },
